1
00:00:00,864 --> 00:00:04,334
(Amy:)Stubbed his toe on the
revolving door on the way in.

2
00:00:04,334 --> 00:00:07,034
(Sheldon:)You know those confounded
things make me dizzy.

3
00:00:07,037 --> 00:00:10,237
(Amy:)Who told you
to keep going around?

4
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,210
(Sheldon:)There was a large
plant in the lobby.

5
00:00:12,209 --> 00:00:14,139
(Sheldon:)It kept looking
like the outside.

6
00:00:15,078 --> 00:00:16,878
(Penny:)Okay, listen,
when Leonard comes out,

7
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,380
(Penny:)he is not gonna feel great,

8
00:00:18,381 --> 00:00:20,551
(Penny:)so, please don't
give him a hard time.

9
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:21,920
(Amy:)Penny has a good point.

10
00:00:21,918 --> 00:00:23,888
(Amy:)This is like the man
in the supermarket

11
00:00:23,887 --> 00:00:25,557
(Amy:)with the goiter on his neck.

12
00:00:25,555 --> 00:00:28,355
(Amy:)Whatever you're thinking,
just keep it to yourself.

13
00:00:28,358 --> 00:00:31,928
(Sheldon:)It was like a grapefruit.

14
00:00:31,928 --> 00:00:33,758
(Amy:)And I'm sure he knew that

15
00:00:33,764 --> 00:00:36,764
(Amy:)before you held
a grapefruit up next to it.

16
00:00:36,767 --> 00:00:38,537
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm not
making any promises.

17
00:00:38,535 --> 00:00:41,405
(Sheldon:)Not only did Leonard take what
I feel is an unnecessary risk,

18
00:00:41,404 --> 00:00:42,704
(Sheldon:)he deceived me.

19
00:00:42,706 --> 00:00:44,076
(Penny:)Okay, the reason
he deceived you is

20
00:00:44,074 --> 00:00:46,044
(Penny:)you were being
a pain in the ass.

21
00:00:46,042 --> 00:00:48,112
(Sheldon:)The reason I was being
a pain in the B is

22
00:00:48,111 --> 00:00:50,411
(Sheldon:)because I was worried about
him, and no one else was.

23
00:00:50,413 --> 00:00:52,043
(Penny:)Really? You won't
even say "A"?

24
00:00:52,048 --> 00:00:54,048
(Sheldon:)You bet your
sweet B I won't.

25
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:56,050
(Penny:)Obviously, I care
about Leonard.

26
00:00:56,052 --> 00:00:58,382
(Penny:)I'm gonna spend the rest
of my life with him.

